# User-uploaded course/lesson images now live in storage/app/public (served
# via the public/storage symlink) instead of public/, so they persist across
# this host's git-based deploys (which reset public/ to whatever is
# committed on every push). Don't track runtime-written content here.
/storage/app/public/kapak-gorseli/*
/storage/app/public/ders-gorselleri/*
!/storage/app/public/kapak-gorseli/.gitkeep
!/storage/app/public/ders-gorselleri/.gitkeep
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
